<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" kicker="Privacy" description="How this independent ClothOff AI publication handles visits, links, and personal data on its static educational website.">
  <h2>Summary</h2>
  <p>This is a static informational website. It has no user accounts, no image uploader, no prompt box, no payment flow, and no database for visitor profiles.</p>
  <h2>Information this site collects</h2>
  <p>The site itself does not set advertising cookies or request sensitive personal information. Our hosting and security provider may process standard technical request data such as IP address, browser type, requested URL, timestamps, and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p>
  <h2>Images and AI prompts</h2>
  <p>We do not accept, process, or store visitor images or AI prompts. Do not send sensitive photos through contact channels.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>Articles may link to primary references or third-party websites. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies. Review those policies before creating an account or uploading content.</p>
  <h2>Retention and requests</h2>
  <p>Because this site does not maintain visitor accounts or an upload database, there is normally no profile or image history for us to delete. A contact method for editorial corrections and privacy questions is provided on the Contact page.</p>
<h2>Google Analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics 4 starts automatically when a normal browser opens a page, without an analytics permission button. It measures page visits, scrolling, outbound link clicks, device information and referral sources. Analytics cookies help distinguish visits and are configured to expire after 180 days, subject to renewal when used. Google may process data outside your country. Google signals, advertising personalization and advertising storage are disabled.</p><p>GA4 automatically excludes known bots and spiders. This site also skips analytics for identifiable crawler user agents and browsers that explicitly identify themselves as automated. These filters cannot guarantee detection of every bot that impersonates a human visitor.</p><p>Global Privacy Control, Do Not Track and the Google Analytics opt-out browser setting are respected. Query strings and fragments are omitted from the page URL in our tag configuration, and referral URLs are reduced to their origin. We do not send chat messages, prompts, uploads or contact-form contents to Analytics. Clearing cookies does not erase data already processed by Google.</p><p>Further information: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p></InfoPage>
